              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kedol Rekoboam Yerusalem, kotukonok ŋesi lukokek loka Yuda ka Benyamin, ituŋa lueseunitai ilukumin akwatat ka ilukumin akais akanykauni, lukeraas ikajiok, aitiji Isirael, ainyakun ajakanut bobo neejai Rekoboam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
